// Task 3 positive fixture: index an AttribArray input and query its
// length.  Indexing yields the element type as a read-only rvalue and
// .length builds the typed length query without demanding a source
// extent.  Folding requires selected-program analysis plus resolved
// type views, so registration stays DISABLED until Task 5 integrates
// CgGeometryAnalyzeProgram into CompileProgram.

TRIANGLE void triangle_main(AttribArray<float4> p : POSITION)
{
    float4 first = p[0];
    int count = p.length;
}
